{"id":"en_fake-bride-and-her-comatose-groom","title":"Fake Bride and Her Comatose Groom","titleEn":"Fake Bride and Her Comatose Groom","description":"The wedding day arrives without a groom. The bride is publicly humiliated when she learns her husband-to-be is having an affair with her younger sister, and she endures the guests' mockery in silence. Her scheming adoptive mother, determined to shield her own daughter, talks her adoptive father into letting the bride take her sister's place at the altar. The man she is now expected to marry is paralyzed and comatose. To recover her mother's inheritance, she reluctantly accepts the unfair arrangement, though she finds some consolation in his handsome looks and kind mother-in-law. What she does not realize is that her new husband is keeping a secret and is not nearly as simple as he seems. Why is he pretending to be unconscious, and how will the two of them build a marriage that slowly turns","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fake-bride-and-her-comatose-groom/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fake-bride-and-her-comatose-groom/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Serendipity","The Comeback","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dvi9e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_fake-bride-and-her-comatose-groom_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dvi9e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fake-bride-and-her-comatose-groom_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dvi9e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fake-bride-and-her-comatose-groom_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"so